[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4200.87, "timestamp": "01:10:00", "text": "埃纳。我比较了解伊娜，因为我一直关注她。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4204.229, "timestamp": "01:10:04", "text": "很多。那么，我们以埃娜为例。埃娜是其中的一部分"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4206.47, "timestamp": "01:10:06", "text": "她的英语。有很多类似的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4208.55, "timestamp": "01:10:08", "text": "她有自己的社区。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4209.63, "timestamp": "01:10:09", "text": "这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4212.91, "timestamp": "01:10:12", "text": "Takodachi，就是墨西哥卷饼，对吧？喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4215.55, "timestamp": "01:10:15", "text": "那。它们是同一部分"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4218.87, "timestamp": "01:10:18", "text": "粉丝文化，对吧？就是这样。你知道，我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4220.63, "timestamp": "01:10:20", "text": "我不太会说话，但我希望你喜欢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4226.709, "timestamp": "01:10:26", "text": "去。如何创建自己的社区"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4229.03, "timestamp": "01:10:29", "text": "就像这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4232.07, "timestamp": "01:10:32", "text": "呃，家人也在这里，对吧？如何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4236.59, "timestamp": "01:10:36", "text": "我创建了自己的社区吗？我继续"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4239.51, "timestamp": "01:10:39", "text": "流媒体互动和点赞"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4242.709, "timestamp": "01:10:42", "text": "让所有进来的人都跳上去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4243.95, "timestamp": "01:10:43", "text": "这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4248.03, "timestamp": "01:10:48", "text": "像流水一样慢慢地流吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4250.95, "timestamp": "01:10:50", "text": "我知道它没有，我不知道，我不擅长"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4253.47, "timestamp": "01:10:53", "text": "这。哦，我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4256.709, "timestamp": "01:10:56", "text": "上帝。等等，希望你能明白。我知道我是"}]